    {
      "id": "claim_6f149fc5f0ff44a08b6d485e1d8a3bc5",
      "statement": "step ssh registers certificate, check-host, config, fingerprint, hosts, inspect, list, login, logout, needs-renewal, proxycommand, rekey, renew, and revoke; loginOnUnauthorized is the shared unauthorized-callback that provisions an x509 identity certificate (OIDC identity token, CreateIdentityRequest, SSHSign, WriteDefaultIdentity) when the CA requires client authentication.",
