    {
      "id": "claim_62463b80bfe44256955de1c9132d83a9",
      "statement": "After SSHSign, login writes the x509 identity certificate when client authentication is required and loads the user (and optional add-user) certificates into the agent, reporting agent failures inline rather than failing the command.",
