      "id": "claim_b54b470e35b3496a84a620b950333509",
      "statement": "internal/sshutil.Agent wraps agent.ExtendedAgent plus its connection (DialAgent uses $SSH_AUTH_SOCK via platform dialers); listing operations are shaped by filter options: WithSignatureKey matches the certificate's signature key against the CA's public keys, WithCertsOnly keeps only certificate-bearing keys, and WithRemoveExpiredCerts actively removes expired certs from the agent during listing.",
