      "statement": "step ssh config builds template data (GOOS, StepPath, StepBasePath, SSH template version key v2, current context name when contexts are enabled, Console with --console, and --set key/values) and detects User from agent certificates signed by the CA, erroring with 'please run step ssh login <identity>' when absent.",
