      "statement": "step ssh proxycommand checks the agent for a valid CA-signed key and performs a full login if missing (doLoginIfNeeded, with one-minute validAfter backdating and identity certificate handling), queries the CA for a bastion via client.SSHBastion, and then connects through the bastion or directly.",
