    {
      "id": "claim_80f0934f7eac499aa4ec63e2b3880a55",
      "statement": "The bastion path re-executes ssh with bastion user/port/flags and 'nc host port' (or a CA-provided command rendered via sshutil.ProxyCommand); the direct path pipes stdin/stdout over a raw TCP connection and returns as soon as either direction finishes because waiting for both can deadlock when the server closes while stdin stays open (smallstep/cli#1641).",
